MAN boot menu additions for GRUB (Debian grub2 2.12-9+deb13u2; applies to 2.14 too).
  gfxmenu: layout = horizontal (start-up disk picker), icon_percent, icon_min,
           icon_max, large_item_font, large_font_from_height, selected_marker
  normal:  menu_layout=horizontal: Left/Right move; menu_mod = modifier held with Enter
  efi console: modifiers reported without a key waiting; Shift with Enter
  keystatus: --wait MS
  efidisk: man_connect (start USB and other drives, list the disks again)
License: GPL-3.0-or-later (as GRUB).

